{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "1acaa089ebf185e571656655ee730a5897f1ac6937619ff809f0660b2bd0cf0b", "ja": "全国ツアー！？", "zh": "全国巡演！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "1acaa089ebf185e571656655ee730a5897f1ac6937619ff809f0660b2bd0cf0b", "ja": "全国ツアー！？", "zh": "全国巡演！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f319a7a560f7d6d7e749d7742e9cb4f04b484cbc348b6f3f4d6c3e14e020b6b0", "ja": "ああ、全国ツアーだ！　みんなで、\n劇場の魅力を全国へ届ける事になった。", "zh": "啊，是全国巡演！我们要一起把剧场的魅力传遍全国。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c3bc9e5b42eafbe11f4d02083766d866ec130b628a2881e2d1c988ee092cbc41", "ja": "その大事なトップバッターを、\nここにいるみんなに任せたいと思う！", "zh": "我想把这个重要的首场演出，交给在场的大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "91850902e3280cb160d14e7c57e7fc789145885a156b7272c92fe7bd9459ad33", "ja": "すっご～い！\nわたしたちがトップバッターなんだ～♪", "zh": "好厉害～！\n我们是开场第一个出场的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "416a074aed3dd1cfd4f7885b062333d0e814b6286e2e77e4138cca2d1ac49511", "ja": "こりゃ、気合い入れてがんばらないとだね～。\nツアーの最初なんて、いつもより責任重大じゃん！", "zh": "这下可得打起精神好好加油了～。\n毕竟是巡演的开场，责任比平时更重大嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c000f05e536569e2f504a80204dfd189cf35293ff93ade243d542ae378faaa17", "ja": "ツアーの初手という事で、どう進めていくか、\n俺もまだ方針を決めきれていないんだが……。", "zh": "既然是巡演的第一步，该怎么推进，我也还没完全确定方针……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ac7b0c106aff32fb486231d6ea7de4b1393ddfc7066cd40fa94e5d0990bd5287", "ja": "みんなと話し合いながら、このツアーを\n作っていきたいと思ってる。よろしく頼む！", "zh": "我想和大家一边商量，一边打造\n这场巡演。拜托大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "f01486325a4fd388c46670803697bb4e8223189ada068a38f28e2cdce6b97fd0", "ja": "もちろんなのです！　困ったときはお互い様、\n何かあったときは、すぐに相談して欲しいのですよ。", "zh": "当然没问题！遇到困难时要互相帮助，\n要是发生什么事，一定要马上来商量哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "8653c261e687be5db6348e2eeff5ca29d9d997a1d9dfa285415bd75ce92b93ad", "ja": "ええ。{$P$}と皆で、\n力を合わせて参りましょう。", "zh": "好的。让我们和{$P$}以及大家一起，齐心协力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "794281a6ca8092bf139a873398967a2c4a18e46d00a2347852428b1a8656adcd", "ja": "ありがとう！　頼もしい返事だな。みんなも、\n何か困った事があったら、相談してくれ。", "zh": "谢谢！真是可靠的回答。大家如果遇到什么困难，也尽管来找我商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "01386ff44e2650fde18b4c705ebbb57d12083aaa07333b3baf90b3ed89029326", "ja": "でしたら……今回は、私達の中からひとり、\nリーダーを決めてはいかがでしょうか。", "zh": "那么……这次不如从我们之中选出一位，担任队长吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "2178a2ef70a1e4f6aa1e1eeac1c4379ecd5c150bea46d0a39c08430d72be1465", "ja": "方針を定め、意見を取りまとめるには、\n指針となる人物がいたほうが良いのではないかと。", "zh": "要制定方针、汇总意见的话，或许还是有一个能够指引大家的人比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "bd2a973d1e5249fdfaa3219fb3df225d5828d41a4f19ce0d70b242eba005d17a", "ja": "あ、それアタシも賛成！", "zh": "啊，我也赞成！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "1b8f6befcc8719070106cd749d81b336fb618fc05cb252d854a8cb2eac0de1c1", "ja": "バラバラで言うより意見まとめてからのほうが、\n{$P$}もいいんじゃない？", "zh": "与其各说各的，不如先把意见汇总起来再说，这样对{$P$}来说也更好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "65e850e6f6f23f266bd37c91cb3b8081e8e7135fa2935b714dc4036f863ca58b", "ja": "確かに、まとめ役のリーダーがいてくれると\n助かるけど。みんなが大変にならないか？", "zh": "确实，要是有个负责统筹的领队的话\n会省事不少。但大家不会太辛苦吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fb8421f93fe1a4160bb054da9dba8931d01a4c847f2151b08b4570befb7e6279", "ja": "リーダー……。", "zh": "队长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "d4b66cd7a0eeb38e1eee6e4a12d3bbd283dc61f7f87203b29b0d1a7cb5c7e3a8", "ja": "（そういえば……翼はリーダーに向いているって、\n話をした事があったな。……よし！）", "zh": "（说起来……我记得以前聊过，翼很适合当队长。……好！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "54dd85b203c3bc33c2dcf6d2c52b3e7c8869aae04aff64e7cb50fea13ed6f731", "ja": "翼。今回のリーダー、やってみるか？", "zh": "翼。要不要试试看担任这次的队长？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "343f259c7518edd0a09f31acaef41bad0fa42131aa6fd719492f32a403c0de6c", "ja": "えっ？　\n……わ、わたしでいいんですか！？", "zh": "诶？  \n……真、真的让我来可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "476d315580a3a4746365014e626f4d4949600d7f58eb8c2fd3d3e0ba89099a0d", "ja": "ああ。翼がリーダーに向いているかもしれない事は、\n『ストロベリーポップムーン』でわかったしな。", "zh": "嗯。通过『草莓流行月』，我也明白了，翼或许很适合当队长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "b37da6ccccb87bc9a0ea84b48e4d20171e147b47fdf77df94cc8ce7c19d39a5f", "ja": "リーダーとして、みんなの意見をよく聞いて\nまとめる事。……どうだ、やってみるか？", "zh": "作为队长，要认真听取大家的意见并加以归纳。……怎么样，要不要试试看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a1c7b80f0effd4f66d06296d1309f0d59df54ad67b8ef9e88a38654691c6568b", "ja": "やった……！　やります、やらせてくださ～い！\nわたし、がんばる……じゃなかった、がんばります！", "zh": "太好了……！我会做的，请让我来吧～！\n我会努力……不对，我一定会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c57840868993e066377d981c207bda7f9252f58686f6f4878177a1fd2dad98f3", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます♪\nみんなも、よろしくお願いしま～す！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢您♪\n大家也要多多关照喽～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "ce26a565231a1c42853103f8f78645ca29561a5e857125ceb0054ef48444599d", "ja": "んじゃ、リーダーよろしくね、翼！\n頼りにしてるよ♪", "zh": "那队长就交给你啰，翼！\n我很看好你哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1027_021mat", "source_sha256": "8a62d4f9454fedbbae87a63834b721ac50416cc09e56574c29dc970f054b9e9d", "ja": "もちろん、姫たちもしっかりサポートするのです。\n翼ちゃん、一緒にがんばるのです♪", "zh": "公主她们当然也会全力协助的。\n翼，一起加油吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1028_008tak", "source_sha256": "0dfd0482f7b73889792014c9d3240d5e5a0cfd8c0066f356c809beaa96712244", "ja": "ええ。共に歩む仲間同士……\n失敗を恐れず、精進して参りましょう。", "zh": "嗯。我们是并肩前行的伙伴……\n不要害怕失败，让我们一起精进吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6563b295bbbecb17cc08c6bfc664e0f9eecdf7b8120f25c9aa51d6f8fb258b16", "ja": "はいっ！　ツアーを成功させられるよう、\nレッスンもライブも、がんばりま～す！", "zh": "好的！为了让巡演取得成功，\n无论是训练还是演出，我都会加油～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "7a809c0f6622c5969610405db722114a539ca9c0eb06a14c972b1afada24755d", "ja": "その意気だ。頼んだぞ、リーダー！\n……えっと、あと話しておく事は……。", "zh": "就要保持这股干劲。拜托你了，队长！\n……呃，还有什么要说的事来着……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1031_021mat", "source_sha256": "21447404c3b1f5d13d8eb542b49d0f2b2ffe2f6dfe88278957f27475c1c97792", "ja": "では、{$P$}さんに質問なのです。\n姫たちの公演は、どこでやる予定なのです？", "zh": "那么，我想问问{$P$}先生。\n公主们的公演，打算在哪里举行呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "c675faa3e5a71f6ede03fee3261620c822722b31d6972cca571f6db720bdf816", "ja": "おっと、それをまだ伝えてなかったな。\n全国ツアーは、南エリアからスタートの予定だ！", "zh": "哎呀，还没告诉你这个呢。\n全国巡演计划从南部地区开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1033_020meg", "source_sha256": "ff40069f33bba1e585fd45e5d0c6d12228314a33b4b4bfc58dd6e4837b52107e", "ja": "南かぁ、ふむふむ……\n季節も季節だし、海が近いトコがいいかも？", "zh": "南方啊，嗯嗯……\n现在正是这个季节，去离海近的地方也许不错？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1034_021mat", "source_sha256": "5619959c9aea8e634441cb0e9526785eab4d442bd94c5a87b511ff0972a3084e", "ja": "海……ひょっとして、泳ぐこともできるのです？\nだったら姫、水着を用意しておかないとなのです！", "zh": "海……难道说，还能游泳吗？\n那样的话，本公主可得准备好泳衣才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1035_021mat", "source_sha256": "b3d684006198f2b3a2fabb240eebf23bd92f869da83fef7249b3c542b7e6fa2f", "ja": "南の海にはきっと、びゅーりほー！な\nウミウシさんがたくさんいるはず……楽しみなのです♪", "zh": "南方的海里一定有很多美——丽！的海蛞蝓……真令人期待呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1036_008tak", "source_sha256": "10df7c1f1e81bbbf5fb88e1d7e956f9e32ef2b0f070ea20d92bd967d039bc54c", "ja": "南にも、珍味や名物がたくさんあると聞いております。\n今から楽しみですね。", "zh": "听说南方也有很多珍馐美味和特产。\n真让人期待呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1037_020meg", "source_sha256": "c361a8dfe551263856ad140b4842e2919e25e6a49862d0ae5caa2a712b949f78", "ja": "ならアタシは、買い物に行きたいかな～。\n地域限定のショップとか巡りたいし！", "zh": "那我想去买东西～还想逛逛当地限定的商店！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1038_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fcf34c476f898ab79e6001a76855ff72141f4167c8b87fb3dd8d9ca64ade7173", "ja": "じゃあみんなで泳いで、お買い物して。\n美味しいものも、いーっぱい食べましょうね～♪", "zh": "那我们大家一起去游泳，再去买东西。\n还要吃好多好多美味的东西哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "9bc505b6ae24941285519ed9e3df7180f456c6007bf2b6bda8e2944d04672a31", "ja": "おいおい、4人とも。目的はライブであって、\n旅行に行くわけじゃないからな？", "zh": "喂喂，你们这4个人。目的可是去参加演唱会，不是去旅游啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1040_016tsu", "source_sha256": "cfc27b4a6aef1b4be05c18073b7dd528c3c71f8849dc003cb8ec1fee0377829a", "ja": "もー、{$P$}さん？\nそれくらい、ちゃんとわかってますってば。", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}先生？\n这种事，我们当然明白啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1041_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2f8a3171c9380f9500c17d40058a6de7e6ad62be9a6888a5b89fade0d6150a7c", "ja": "それに、わたしたちが楽しくないと、お客さんも\n楽しめないですよね？　だからいいんでーす！", "zh": "而且，如果我们自己都不开心，客人也没法开心起来吧？所以这样就好啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1042_p", "source_sha256": "0fdee9760379f9c3bb5071af91949ea946a79386b1b42993350fba63471199f5", "ja": "そ、そうだな……。\nいや、本当にそうか……？", "zh": "对、对啊……\n不，真的是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0194_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0194_story_01_1043_p", "source_sha256": "ea55a7477379670867ed85611781521979afe766e86b31c40d4ee030b565935e", "ja": "（なかなか自由な……個性的なユニットになりそうだ。\nこれからしっかり、まとめていかないとな！）", "zh": "（看来会成为一个相当自由……很有个性的组合。接下来得好好把大家组织起来才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
